                                                "sense_id": "c68fb8fd-0dab-3931-b3a5-53ca27e122d9",
                                                "text": "[...] unlike the latest British yards, Gremberg has only primary retarders, manually operated, a method that the hump operators apparently prefer to electro-pneumatic control because they can grade the braking pressure more accurately by feel."
                                            }
                                        ]
